  "description": "High-tech Frame\n\nH200 Pro features a high quality ultra-light aluminum frame that makes it easy to ride and move, corrosion resistant and very easy to clean and maintain. The internal installation of the shift cables and brake hoses contributes to a longer life of your cables.\n\nBRAKES & GEAR\n\nPowerful dual disc brakes are more efficient than other brakes, providing you with better stopping power for your adventures in rough and wet terrain. The 18-speed drive allows you to find the higher gear to achieve speed.\n\nFRONT FORK\n\nThe front fork with adjustable cushioning absorbs bumps and indentations for a quieter ride. On smooth roads, the suspension does not absorb your pedaling force, so you can pedal more efficiently.\n\nXC Tire\n\nThe double wall rim is more stable. The 26 inch XC tyre is not only thin and fast, but also non-slip and wear-resistant. It has strong adhesion and is puncture proof, giving you more stability on hills, gravel and trails.\n\nPurchase advice\n\nThe bike with 26 inch wheels is suitable for riders between 150 cm and 170 cm, the bike with 27.5 inch wheels for riders between 168 cm and 182 cm. 85% pre-assembled, easy to assemble, installation tool included. Please do not install the fork upside down.",
